        }
        // MUTATION (gen 103): harvest-aware open — if the fresh bin would be
        // the only bin able to hold the next item while existing open slack
        // cannot, and the fresh bin's own post-residual can chain the next
        // item, reward the open as a guaranteed-capacity lane.
