            score -= (6.0 + 8.0 * scarcity) * fill * (progress - 0.4);
        }
        // gen 104 (new): residual-variance damper — when this placement
        // leaves a post-residual close to the aggregate mean residual, the
        // stream keeps a uniform pool of usable slack; reward that harmony
