            score -= 5.0 * fill * (progress - 0.5);
        }
        // MUTATION (gen 150): two-step tiling gradient — when the next item
        // can be placed here AND the resulting residual still accommodates
        // the item after that (estimated as next_item_size again), this bin
        // supports a multi-item chain; deepen the reward as the chain
