                score += 13.0 * (1.0 - frac) * (0.4 + 0.6 * progress);
            }
        }
        // MUTATION (gen 81): consolidation pull — prefer the bin whose
        // placement brings it closest to full relative to competing bins,
        // tightening late-stream residual spread. gen 164: start earlier
        // (progress > 0.4) and add a small always-on fill gradient to keep
        // residuals monotonically shrinking mid-stream.
